        "text": {
            "description_html": "<a name=\"LAU-54628\"><b>Laurey 54628, Modern Ultima Cabinet Knob in Satin Nickel</b></a>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Satin Nickel Ultima Cabinet Knob features a slight steeped design on the base of the mount. This Kitchen Cabinet Knob has a  1-3/8 inch diameter. It is designed to be used with the <a href=\"//search?type=product&q=Laurey+Ultima\">Laurey Ultima Collection</a>. The Modern Ultima Cabinet Knob in Satin Nickel comes packaged with the mounting hardware. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the Laurey Satin Nickel Ultima Cabinet Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Zinc</li>\r\n<li>Finish: Satin Nickel</li>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with 1\" long #8-32 screw and 1-1/2\" long #8-32 screw.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 4 finishes:</b>\r\n<table width=\"600\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" align=\"center\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<a href=\"#LAU-54628\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/LAU-54628-SM.jpg?v=1704354587\" width=\"150\" height=\"100\" alt=\"LAU-54628\"></a>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<a href=\"/products/polished-chrome-ultima-cabinet-knob-laurey-54626\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/LAU-54626-SM.jpg?v=1704354587\" width=\"150\" height=\"100\" alt=\"LAU-54626\"></a>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<a href=\"/products/matte-black-cabinet-knob-laurey-54620\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/LAU-54620-SM.jpg?v=1704354652\" width=\"150\" height=\"100\" alt=\"LAU-54620\"></a>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<a href=\"/products/oil-rubbed-bronze-cabinet-knob-laurey-54666\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/LAU-54666-SM.jpg?v=1704354652\" width=\"150\" height=\"100\" alt=\"LAU-54666\"></a>\r\n</td>\r\n\r\n\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"text\" align=\"center\">\r\n<td>\r\n<a href=\"#LAU-54628\"><b>Satin Nickel</b></a>\r\n</td>\r\n<t